    "detailed_description": "Lost Souls takes you and your friends on an epic adventure!<br><br>In single player mode, you can test yourself by passing the most difficult tests:<br>Gather supplies              - craft powerful weapons to fight against various opponents.<br>                                       - build a temporary shelter to take a breath from the huge number of deaths.<br> <br>Explore the dungeon     - study each level carefully, as you may miss something valuable.<br>                                       - before studying the level, I recommend storing the extracted loot in the chest<br><br>Fight monsters - each enemy has its own unique characteristics and loot<br>                                       - with each level, the enemy is smarter and more dangerous: come up with different tactics<br>                                       <br>Skills - Become a tank with a lot of health and stone skin<br>                                       - Become a magician with a different number of abilities and destroy hordes of enemies with one glance.<br>                                       - Get a lot of resources with just one touch<br><br>Trade - There are many unique merchants who will gladly sell valuable items<br>                                       - each merchant is unique<br><br>Treasures - Find mountains of gold to trade<br>                                       - Somewhere in the dungeon you can find a unique weapon.<br>                                       - The caches are full of different potions and resources.<br><br>Multiplayer<br>An open world with a lot of dungeons (but they still need to be found)<br>also waiting for you<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>beautiful Graphics</li></ul></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><ul class=\"bb_ul\">[*unusual atmosphere[/h2]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><ul class=\"bb_ul\">[*secret events[/h2]<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>interesting Dungeons</li></ul></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>various Enemies &amp; Bosses</li></ul></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>various Treasure Caches</li></ul></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And Much More</h2></ul></h2></ul></h2>",
